    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if i want to be a witness to it. witnessing the \"cold\" just sounds exhausting if there's no warmth waiting at the end. if life is just being a witness to a void that doesn't care about us, then why do we even bother keeping the lights on? wouldn't it just be easier to let the darkness take over?",
